Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:06.49,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:08.48,TL,,0,0,0,,上海大师赛第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.51,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘五平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.30,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫拿下这个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.45,TL,,0,0,0,,再发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:15.83,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}击败西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:35.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The former champion has produced one of his best performances of the year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N前冠军打出了今年最佳表现之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:37.95,TL,,0,0,0,,这是两人第{\fs78}16{\fs68}次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:40.16,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫{\fs78}11{\fs68}胜{\fs78}5{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.92,TL,,0,0,0,,大满贯{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.34,TL,,0,0,0,,可在年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:46.10,TL,,0,0,0,,他两次都输给了西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:50.78,TL,,0,0,0,,故事要从{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年的迈阿密说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:53.71,TL,,0,0,0,,那年{\fs78}3{\fs68}月 迈阿密首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:55.50,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}22{\fs68}岁的梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:58.58,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次碰上{\fs78}19{\fs68}岁的西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:03.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Going to make an exit off court for a moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他要暂时离场一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:10.80,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘打完 西西帕斯去了洗手间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:13.69,TL,,0,0,0,,这一去 就是好一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:18.57,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 梅德韦杰夫逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:21.75,TL,,0,0,0,,可真正的故事 在握手之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:29.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite a start on the year as a 2-6, 6-4, 6-2 win, and some words.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N逆转取胜 还附带一番口角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:31.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You don't say sorry, you think you're a good kid?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你不道歉 还觉得自己是个好孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:33.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Look at me. Hey, look at me, huh?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看着我 喂 看着我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:35.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You don't look at me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你都不敢看我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:41.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He started it. He started it. Yes, he started it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是他先挑事的 是他先挑事的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:43.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He said, Russian, you think this is normal?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他骂我 俄罗斯 这正常吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:46.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I answered him because he doesn't know how to fight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我回他 是因为他不懂怎么较量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:48.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's a small kid who doesn't know how to fight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他就是个不懂怎么较量的小屁孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:50.94,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫的说法是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.21,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯擦网得分没有道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.21,TL,,0,0,0,,握手时 还骂了他一句
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:57.19,TL,,0,0,0,,带着 俄罗斯 的脏话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:01:58.86,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯后来承认
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.28,TL,,0,0,0,,那天自己生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:02.97,TL,,0,0,0,,说了那些话 也后悔了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:07.77,TL,,0,0,0,,此后一年多 梅德韦杰夫连赢{\fs78}5{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.49,0:02:10.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年美网之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.44,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫透露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.25,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯在{\fs78}Instagram{\fs68}上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:14.88,TL,,0,0,0,,把他拉黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年{\fs78}8{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.87,0:02:21.27,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫这样形容两人的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:24.24,TL,,0,0,0,,不是敌人 但绝对不是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:27.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月上海半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:30.05,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯第五次输给他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:31.76,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后他只用一个词
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:34.24,TL,,0,0,0,,形容这场比赛 无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.99,0:02:38.23,TL,,0,0,0,,一个月后的伦敦年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:41.18,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯终于赢了一次 他说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:43.25,TL,,0,0,0,,我不恨他 但就像他说的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:45.69,TL,,0,0,0,,我们不会一起吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:51.03,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年澳网半决赛 矛盾彻底爆发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.67,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 梅德韦杰夫认定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:57.08,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯的父亲在看台上一直指导
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:03:00.73,TL,,0,0,0,,换边时 他冲主裁大吼 你傻吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:03.27,TL,,0,0,0,,他父亲每一分都能说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.27,0:03:05.49,TL,,0,0,0,,还骂主裁是 小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:14.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What just unfolded at the tail end of that second set?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘末尾到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.42,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫被罚了款
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:18.77,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯这边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:20.71,TL,,0,0,0,,随后也因为看台上的指导
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.63,TL,,0,0,0,,吃到一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:27.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘过后 梅德韦杰夫闯进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:32.26,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 两人换了一种方式较劲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.09,0:03:34.53,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年{\fs78}8{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:36.42,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:40.34,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 这一次领先的是西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:51.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a first Cincinnati final for Stefanos Tsitsipas.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N西西帕斯首进辛辛那提决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.99,TL,,0,0,0,,赢球之后 他在场上跳起了舞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:00.56,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}个月后的罗马半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:04.14,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}赢了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:09.51,TL,,0,0,0,,赛点拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:11.85,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次轮到梅德韦杰夫跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:13.85,TL,,0,0,0,,他算是还了回去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:21.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a third Masters 1000 final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他第三个大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:23.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So, let's see what comes out with this one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看看这次跳成什么样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:26.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because when you do it, it's like being in the club completely drunk.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N跳的时候 就像在夜店喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:30.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}When you're dancing, and I have a lot of friends like this,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N跳舞的时候 我很多朋友也这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:33.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}you feel like you're the god of the dance floor.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你会觉得自己是舞池之王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:34.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But then when they show you the video,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可等别人把视频拿给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}you know it was not the thing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你才知道根本不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.39,0:04:39.47,TL,,0,0,0,,这几年 火药味慢慢淡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:41.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年上海
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:43.55,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫又赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:44.96,TL,,0,0,0,,那年{\fs78}9{\fs68}月他说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:46.95,TL,,0,0,0,,两人显然不是最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:49.43,TL,,0,0,0,,但{\fs78}100{\fs68}%尊重对方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年{\fs78}2{\fs68}月多哈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:54.45,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯直落两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:55.99,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:58.67,TL,,0,0,0,,对梅德韦杰夫的第一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:04.69,TL,,0,0,0,,上海赛前 西西帕斯说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:07.24,TL,,0,0,0,,那些事随着时间已经化解了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}号这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.81,0:05:12.12,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫一个破发点都没给对手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:17.59,TL,,0,0,0,,西西帕斯排名掉到第{\fs78}43{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:18.83,TL,,0,0,0,,但就在这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.58,TL,,0,0,0,,他拿到了生涯第{\fs78}400{\fs68}场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:24.26,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫世界第{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.34,TL,,0,0,0,,这个赛季已经拿了{\fs78}3{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:27.91,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月初的中网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:30.55,TL,,0,0,0,,他击球打中观众 被判失格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:33.09,TL,,0,0,0,,下一轮 他对保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:37.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}年 从争吵到握手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:41.03,TL,,0,0,0,,下次见面 你想看到哪一幕？
